 - 2026-06-17: PHASE F3 (hardware continuity; opportunistic per north-star §3) -- KV260 terminal/opportunistic (SSH-only reachability + xmutil listapps; NO host SD-card precondition), PolarFire CPU dispatch hash-verify, GateMate USB detect. KV260 is terminal (north-star §3) so the per-board mandate relaxes to opportunistic; this task keeps the boards visible without blocking the milestone. Report per-board reachability + any opportunistic result. NO board blocks the milestone (honest blocked_<board> per board is fine). (⚠️ Blocked) — honest_verdict=complete: hardware_continuity_4311_kv260_kv260_terminal_xmutil_listapps_blocked_returncode_1_polarfire_polarfire_hash_verified_cpu_dispatch_succeeded_gatemate_blocked_gatemate_unreachable_ssh_usb_reachability_only; results/experiment_4311_hardware_continuity.json
 - 2026-06-17: PHASE F4 (capstone .398, UNGATED) -- the verifier scorecard, using the robust aggregate-available-report-gaps helper from exp4308 (NO hard-block-all-False). Headline questions: (1) did EFFICIENCY-PARITY harden against a WELL-prompted judge on an iso-FLOPs curve (the operator's §5 win condition)? (2) did the IN-GENERATION moat hold with GENUINELY-ENGAGED controls (not no-ops)? (3) did the selection moat BROADEN to a HELD-OUT DOMAIN (with label-ablation)? Aggregate (skipping flagged; reporting missing as per-axis gaps): EFFICIENCY = exp4303 efficiency_pareto_holds + cost_ratio + accuracy_delta_ci95; IN-GENERATION = exp4304 diffusiongemma_guidance_moat + controls_differentiated + scorer_leak_recheck_passed; CROSS-DOMAIN = exp4305 cross_domain_selection_holds + cross_domain_delta + label_ablation_robust; SELF-LEARNING = exp4306 online_adaptation_helps (powered CI); ARC = exp4307 total_levels (>=23?); hygiene = exp4310 regression_guard_passed. Emit efficiency_pareto_hardened + in_generation_moat_holds + cross_domain_moat_holds + verifier_thesis_state (one honest string). SKIP any flagged_adversarial artifact; HONOR verifier_is_oracle (a circular/execution-grounded win is NOT a moat). Compute the G1-G4 publication gate via publication_gate.py. NO gated_on. (✅ Complete) — honest_verdict=complete: v398_efficiency_hardened_in_generation_open_cross_domain_open_self_learning_helps_arc_excluded; results/experiment_4312_capstone_v398.json
 - 2026-06-17: [conductor] Operational retrospective for milestone 2026.06.398 (results/operational_retro_2026_06_398.json, schema carnot.operational_retro.v64). Authoritative milestone-scoped timing detector again false-zeroed (0 experiment commits since activation), so locked timing fields are 0/empty and gpu_idle_on_compute_bound_tasks=null (both RTX 3090s correctly idle at rest, 0 compute-bound tasks). On-disk ground truth read this turn (results/experiment_4303..4312, clean unflagged capstone exp4312) shows ~10 experiments actually ran -- the recurring .363-.396 false-zero detector gap now extends to .398. Operational bottleneck: observability (missing per-experiment wall-time telemetry), NOT execution; top action = repair the milestone-scoped timing detector / add mtime+changelog-window fallback + write-time duration_s stamping. No GPU/DualGPURunner change warranted. estimated_time_savings_pct=5.
+- 2026-06-17: Archive .398 -> activate .399; KEEP the hardened green-gate + poison-test quarantine. Assert research-complete.yaml + ops/exclusion_manifest.yaml parse under yaml.safe_load; run the smart-subset pre-test gate green; RECORD the TRUE .398 close-state truthfully (per exp4312 capstone): verifier_thesis_state=efficiency_parity_hardened; EFFICIENCY-PARITY HARDENED (exp4303 efficiency_pareto_holds=true, energy 0.8 vs judge 0.5, cost_ratio 1.03e-08, accuracy_delta_ci95 [0.1,0.5] excl 0, verifier_is_oracle=false -- the operator's §5 win condition, MET); SELF-LEARNING HELPS powered (exp4306 online_adaptation_helps=true, +0.529, CI95 [0.408,0.651] excl 0); IN-GENERATION moat OPEN/UNDERPOWERED-POSITIVE (exp4304 diffusiongemma_guidance_moat=false, carnot_minus_best_control_delta +0.133, CI95 [-0.067,0.367] incl 0, controls_differentiated=true, scorer_leak_recheck_passed=true -- a clean harness needing a stronger method + more power); CROSS-DOMAIN moat OPEN/UNDERPOWERED-POSITIVE (exp4305 cross_domain_selection_holds=false, cross_domain_delta +0.231, CI95 [-0.115,0.538] incl 0, label_ablation_robust=true, GAP-CROSS-DOMAIN-FAMILY-INVARIANT-SELECTION-4305 logged); ARC stalled at 22 on a HARNESS failure (exp4307 FLAGGED GATE_PASSED_WITHOUT_DATA: frontier adapter unavailable, exploration_actions_used=0 -- NOT a science failure); INFRA shipped (exp4308 DEGENERATE_CONTROLS check + robust aggregate-available helper); paper_ready=True (FoVer 0.9131, G1-G4 pass). Frame .399 as close-the-two-open-moats (cross-domain + in-generation) + deploy-efficiency-cascade + unstall-ARC. (⚠️ Research Finding) — honest_verdict=success: archived_v398_v399_active_efficiency_hardened_True_self_learning_helps_True_two_moats_open_arc_harness_stall_22; results/experiment_4313_archive_v398_activate_v399.json
